*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* SELECTION-SCREEN
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
"향후 권한 연동하여 User별 Defalut 값 관리 시 Display 필드로 변경(BUKRS/WERKS/RUSER/AUSER)
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S01.
  PARAMETERS     : P_BUKRS LIKE EKKO-BUKRS,
                   P_WERKS LIKE EKPO-WERKS MODIF ID C01. "RQD APM APD
  SELECT-OPTIONS : S_BSART  FOR EKKO-BSART MODIF ID C02, "RQD APM APD
                   S_EKGRP  FOR EKKO-EKGRP MODIF ID C03  "RQD APM APD
                              NO INTERVALS NO-EXTENSION,
                   S_LIFNR  FOR EKKO-LIFNR MODIF ID C04, "APM
                   S_EBELN  FOR EKKO-EBELN MODIF ID C05, "RQD APM APD
                   S_AEDAT  FOR EKKO-AEDAT MODIF ID C06, "RQD APM APD
                   S_RUSER  FOR SY-UNAME   MODIF ID C07  "RQP RQD
                          MATCHCODE OBJECT USER_ADDR,    "추가(SJM 25.02.17)
                   S_RDATE  FOR SY-DATLO   MODIF ID C08, "RQP
                   S_AUSER  FOR SY-UNAME   MODIF ID C09, "RQP RQD APM APD
                   S_ADATE  FOR SY-DATLO   MODIF ID C10. "RQP RQD APM
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S02.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    PARAMETERS : P_ALL RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1 MODIF ID C11  "RQD APM APD
                             DEFAULT 'X' USER-COMMAND GR1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 6.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R01 MODIF ID C11 FOR FIELD P_ALL.
    PARAMETERS : P_NDS RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1 MODIF ID C11. "RQD APM APD
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 30.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R02 MODIF ID C11 FOR FIELD P_NDS.
    PARAMETERS : P_YDS RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1 MODIF ID C11. "RQD APM APD
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 54.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R03 MODIF ID C11 FOR FIELD P_YDS.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF LINE.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK2.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK3 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S03.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    PARAMETERS : P_RQP RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR2 DEFAULT 'X'
                                        USER-COMMAND GR2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 6.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R04 FOR FIELD P_RQP.
    PARAMETERS : P_RQD RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 30.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R05 FOR FIELD P_RQD.
    PARAMETERS : P_APM RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 54.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R06 FOR FIELD P_APM.
    PARAMETERS : P_APD RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 78.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R07 FOR FIELD P_APD.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF LINE.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK3.
